  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2019-2026 Chevy Silverado & GMC Sierra 1500 (Excl 2019 Ld/Lt)\n2020-2026 2500 HD 3500 HD Crew Cab\nFeatures\nFITMENT: Custom-designed specifically compatible with 2019-2026 Chevy Silverado & GMC Sierra 1500 (Excl 2019 Ld/Lt), 2020-2026 2500 HD 3500 HD Crew Cab. Please check the cab size picture if you are unsure of your exact model\nUNIQUE SPLIT DESIGN: Unlike traditional full-length running boards, our innovative 4-piece independent split design offers a rugged, modern off-road look allow flexible installation and individual replacement if needed\nRELIABLE NON-SLIP TRACTION: The step surface features an aggressive hexagonal mesh pattern that provides exceptional slip resistance in all weather conditions-rain, snow, or mud-ensuring safe and secure footing for you and your passengers\nRELIABLE NON-SLIP TRACTION: The step surface features an aggressive hexagonal mesh pattern that provides exceptional slip resistance in all weather conditions-rain, snow, or mud-ensuring safe and secure footing for you and your passengers\nEASY BOLT-ON INSTALLATION: Package includes a set of 4 split steps (left and right), heavy-duty mounting brackets, and all necessary hardware. Bolt-on installation holes with no drilling required.\nProfessional installation recommended",
